@startuml review_layout_00_baseline
' Review unit 00 of 05 -- see docs/review_layout.md for the series.
' State AT commit 94efaaf, main after PR #23, where the rebased branch starts.
' Every number below is from a run of the cases at commit 94efaaf.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/review_layout_00_baseline.puml

title Unit 00 -- baseline: where occupied cells sit when the branch starts (94efaaf)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCFCFC
  BorderColor #777777
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F2F2F2
  DiamondBorderColor #777777
}
skinparam partition {
  BorderColor #8899AA
  FontColor #33495E
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF0
  BorderColor #C8C08A
}

start

partition "the call" {
  :GenerateData(num_obs=100, num_dims=3, ratio_dims=[1, 2, 2], seed=77,
     <b>case A</b>: density=[0.4, 0.1], num_vars=2, var_dims=[3, 2], overlap=0.5
     <b>case S</b>: density=0.4 (one variable)
     max_obs=None (serial) or 40 (parallel, merge_nc=True));
  note right
    No layout keyword: passing one raises
    TypeError: GenerateData.~__init~__() got an
    unexpected keyword argument 'layout'
  end note
}

partition "validate and configure" {
  :shape [4, 8, 8], num_obs 102
  minimum density = max(shape) / prod(shape) = 8 / 256 = 0.03125
  case A: var_num_obs 102 and 6 (var1: 0.1 of its own 64 cells)
  dim_split 1 (8 strata);
}

partition "RecordGenerator.generate_stratified_indices  (the only placement)" {
  :LHS stage: max(shape) = 8 points, every coordinate of every axis used;
  :fill: the rest apportioned over strata by free sites,
  then drawn uniformly within each stratum;
}

#FFF9C4:<b>where the cells sit</b>, case S, along x2 (32 lines of 8 cells)
cells per line: min 1, median 3, mean 3.19, max 6
each line fills its first k cells (positions 0..k-1): <b>no</b>.
scattered: a cell's neighbour is occupied about as often as the density;

#FFF9C4:files: case S ds.nc 14061 B, parquet 5396 B
case A ds.nc 15729 B, parquet 6012 B, 105 rows
serial equals parallel in both;

:report rows: density, coverage (var0), overlap F1, observations,
values in parquet. Nothing about the arrangement;

stop

legend right
  |<#C8E6C9> green |= added or changed by THIS unit |
  |<#FFCDD2> red |= removed by THIS unit |
  |<#FFE0B2> orange |= single-variable flow touched by THIS unit |
  |<#FFF9C4> yellow |= generated data or file that changed as a result |
  | plain | unchanged since the previous unit |

  <b>Unit 00 is the reference</b>, not a change.
  density fixes how many cells are occupied;
  nothing yet fixes where they sit.
end legend

@enduml
